il cui governo è minacciato da Mukade. Riuscirà Naruto a tornare nel suo tempo e può un incontro casuale nel passato salvare il futuro?"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Naruto Shippuden the Movie: The Lost Tower","overview":"Assigned on a mission to capture Mukade, a missing-nin, Naruto Uzumaki sets out for the once glorious historic ruins of \"Ouran\", where he pursues and corners the rouge ninja. Mukade's goal is revealed to be a dormant leyline within the ruins; he unleashes the power of the leyline, causing a light to envelop Naruto, sending him into the past, 20 years before the series began. When Naruto awakens, he comes into contact with the Fourth Hokage, Minato Namikaze."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"抜け忍ムカデ追跡任務を受け、砂隠れの廃墟・楼蘭へと向かったナルト。追い詰められたムカデは、廃墟に眠る龍脈の力を解放し、ナルトは過去の世界へ飛ばされてしまう!突如襲来する謎の傀儡集団!!そのときナルトを救ったのは、若き日の四代目火影・波風ミナトだった。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nxX0krYEzLuDrnZistEAjosPYXG.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nxX0krYEzLuDrnZistEAjosPYXG.png","language":"it","width":2409,"height":1766},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x5JS4KhtQlVIvKxwUfqw9ctvHfW.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/x5JS4KhtQlVIvKxwUfqw9ctvHfW.png","language":"en","width":969,"height":531},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/elFJ2gel8EIgAGuHaLtM3miNNVx.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/elFJ2gel8EIgAGuHaLtM3miNNVx.png","language":"ja","width":729,"height":530}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mtyIBwILaTGEqNAtogxXqA1QJlS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mtyIBwILaTGEqNAtogxXqA1QJlS.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yXgmhQYWKpcy3Ts0dIHDnU69Srm.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yXgmhQYWKpcy3Ts0dIHDnU69Srm.jpg","language":"it","width":1200,"height":1600},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/